WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.440
At American colleges,

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.700
if you are a faculty member

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.260
and you want more pay or a promotion,

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.400
you must publish articles

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.700
in journals like these

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.640
since the journals supposedly have high standards…

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.000
some researchers were thrilled to get an email

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.420
from a journal that said:

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.040
I have now closely considered the revisions

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.880
of your manuscript dog park.”

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.200
[laughs] Dog park!!

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.800
They’re laughing because they’d just pulled off a hoax.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.020
“...and will recommend
its publication in Gender, Place, and Culture.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.460
[laughs]

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.080
they'd sent so-called research to

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.780
20 prominent journals in women and gender studies,

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.640
race studies, sexuality fat and queer studies.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.600
For this journal of social work…

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.880
We rewrote

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.480
a section of Mein Kampf as intersectional feminism.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.080
And this journal has accepted it.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.560
Seven of their crazy papers got in.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.400
And one that claims that dog humping incidents

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.500
can be taken as evidence of rape culture

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.220
– has been officially honored as “excellent scholarship”.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.280
I'm thinking oh my god, we got a paper in

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.240
and it's probably the craziest thing we wrote

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:06.260
James Lindsay is a mathematician.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.760
Peter Boghossian teaches philosophy..

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.720
Helen Pluckrose runs an academic magazine in London.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.980
They didn’t really expect that the journal of

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.680
gender, place and culture would accept their paper,

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.520
in which they claimed to have “closely” examined

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:22.840
genitals of nearly 10,000 dogs

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.620
to learn about rape culture and queer performativity.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.380
Did they just not read these things and accept them?

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.380
Oh no.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.200
They read them very very carefully.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.180
They read them in detail.

00:01:32.180 --> 00:01:34.100
How could they believe you examined

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.040
10,000 dog genitals?

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.540
We have no idea, in fact in the ...

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:38.240
[Laughs]

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.960
the first draft of that paper we were like,

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:42.220
there is no way they're gonna believe that we did this.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:44.540
We think studying topics
like gender race

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.140
and sexuality is worthwhile

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:48.620
and getting it right is extremely important.

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:50.380
They made this video to explain

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.920
why they tested the journals.

00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.300
A culture has developed

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.000
in which only certain conclusions are allowed

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.560
-- like those that make whiteness

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.920
and masculinity problematic.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.580
Basically

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.300
it’s not correct

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.440
that there is such a thing as biological sex.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:05.760
Kind of a last straw happened.

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:07.920
There was this paper, well-funded by the

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.160
National Science Foundation that

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.100
studied feminist glaciology.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.720
it said that glacier science is sexist

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:17.500
Because the majority of glaciological knowledge

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.000
that we have today stems from knowledge created

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.680
by men about men

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:26.100
within existing masculinist stories.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.680
The paper’s remedy?

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.780
Feminist paintings of glaciers and

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.240
feminist art projects that,

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:33.420
I'm not kidding,

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.420
hooked up a phone line to a glacier so you could

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.380
call the glacier on the phone and listen to it.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.880
So that was the last straw for me

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.360
These aren't your fields.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.240
No. No.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:42.600
No.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.900
Which should have made it more difficult.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:46.220
Much more difficult to fool the journals,

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:46.840
but --

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.100
Papers started getting in.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.540
You ** got to be ** that this happened!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.360
This shouldn't have been possible.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:56.180
What appears beyond dispute is that making absurd

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:59.100
and horrible ideas sufficiently politically fashionable

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.280
can get them validated at the highest levels

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.840
of academic grievance studies.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:05.120
We flattered what they wanted to hear

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.280
and then they told us that it was

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.660
an important contribution to feminist geography.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.140
Maybe these are just mills that accept every paper.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:16.360
No. One journal we hoaxed was Hypatia,

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.300
which is one of the two leading feminist journals.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.300
It has about an 18 percent acceptance rate.

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:23.340
[Barking dogs]

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.140
The researchers didn’t get to finish their experiment

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:29.600
because the dog rape paper was so over-the-top,

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.980
a Wall Street Journal reporter noticed.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.920
She exposed the hoax and ended the experiment

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:37.600
before all the journals had weighed in.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:41.360
The 7 that accepted the fake papers did retract them.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.920
But what upsets me most is what happened next.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.520
No university said “hmm ...

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.380
... we’re not gonna use these journals.”

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:50.260
No editor publicly said,

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:52.080
“we have to raise our standards.”

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:55.120
Think about if you did this to civil engineers

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.260
with bridge-building.

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:57.380
They would've thanked us.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:57.940
Right?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.240
Because they're driving over the bridges

00:03:59.240 --> 00:03:59.940
with their families.

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.500
So they don't want the bridges to collapse.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.840
But the grievance study journal editors,

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.460
instead of admitting that they’d published nonsense,

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.400
criticized the hoaxers.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.680
You've clearly engaged in flawed and

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.200
unethical research.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.620
That was our whole point.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.160
A dozen of Peter’s fellow professors wrote

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.600
an anonymous letter attacking him

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:21.480
and the school newspaper ran it with this cartoon

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.260
depicting peter as a clown.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.820
You're part of a clown car of hoax writers engaging in

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.780
fraudulent, time-wasting, anti-intellectual activities.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.980
Right. They just described their own discipline.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.920
Do you dread walking to class?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:35.680
Yes.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.820
I've been spat on.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:38.520
I've been physically threatened.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:41.540
Portland State University, instead of applauding Peter

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.920
for exposing nonsense,

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.280
may fire him.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.860
I called Portland State, asking for an interview,

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.400
but they declined.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.500
How can a college criticize the hoaxers,

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:56.040
but revere ridiculous journals that publish nonsense?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.420
When you live in these tight ecosystems,

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.120
this stuff makes total sense.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.180
There's a pervading rape culture, men are bad.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.220
The whole ball of wax.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:08.080
20 years ago, a physicist submitted a

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.700
nonsense paper to the journal “Social Text”,

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.500
saying gravity just a “social construct”.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.680
That embarrassed the journal,

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.260
But Social Text is still going strong,

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:22.200
and at universities, nothing really changed.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.100
The best I can tap into is that this is kind of like a

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.960
religious architecture in their mind where privilege is sin.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.140
So you can come up with these really nasty arguments

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.000
like to put white kids and chains in the floor.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.920
It's an educational opportunity.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:38.540
And if you frame it in terms of overcoming privilege

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:40.060
then it ... right in.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.080
And anyone who dares criticize that

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.320
must be a conservative hack,

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.080
holding the same ideological position

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.260
as the Trump administration’s  attack on trans rights.

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:53.000
Maybe you are just conservative hacks

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.200
looking to defend white, your white privilege.

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:58.160
I don’t think so.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:00.620
I’ve never voted for a republican in my life.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:01.820
Nor have I

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.780
Actually none of the hoaxers is conservative.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.140
My collaborators and I are left-wing academics

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.820
who can now say with confidence

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.240
these people don't speak for us.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.800
The scholarship in these disciplines is utterly corrupted.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.020
They have placed an agenda before the truth.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.240
After this interview,

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.420
the editor of one of the hoaxed journals

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.100
did agree to talk to me.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.240
Maybe you shouldn't be doing what you're doing

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:28.760
because it's gibberish, and they've proved it.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.320
Yeah, yeah they didn’t prove, that's the problem.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.640
That video will be available soon.

